{"id":"88191d3e06281669","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-ct.md","title":"Church–Turing 论题的元理论地位","display":"df-ct — Church–Turing 论题的元理论地位","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-ct","aliases":["20-df-ct"],"display":"df-ct — Church–Turing 论题的元理论地位","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"metatheory","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§17.2 模型等价与 Church–Turing 论题；§17.3","source_pdf_pages":[261],"source_printed_pages":[234],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-thm-ct-equiv]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-ct"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-ct</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ct — Church–Turing 论题的元理论地位"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"metatheory"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§17.2 模型等价与 Church–Turing 论题；§17.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>261</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>234</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0399f7532457c99d\" href=\"?note=0399f7532457c99d\" title=\"20-thm-ct-equiv\">20-thm-ct-equiv</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k\">\\(\\mathcal C_k\\)</span> 是 Turing 部分函数族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}_k\\)</span> 是 μ-递归部分函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0399f7532457c99d\" href=\"?note=0399f7532457c99d\" title=\"20-thm-ct-equiv\">20-thm-ct-equiv</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ct}\\vdash\n\\mathcal C_k=\\mathrm{PR}_k\\qquad(k\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ct}\\vdash\n\\mathcal C_k=\\mathrm{PR}_k\\qquad(k\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显示式只记录两个形式模型的已证等价。Church–Turing 论题另外主张每个直观有效可算的数值函数都由 Turing 机计算；由于左侧直观概念不是本框架中的数学定义，该论题不是上述等式的另一条形式定理，也没有可用的形式化证明。此原子是术语和对象／元层边界说明。</p>\n<p>来源：§17.2 模型等价与 Church–Turing 论题；§17.3；印刷页 234；PDF 第 261 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ct-equiv","status":"resolved","id":"0399f7532457c99d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-ct-equiv]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-ct-equiv]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ct-equiv","status":"resolved","id":"0399f7532457c99d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-thm-ct-equiv]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ct}\\vdash\n\\mathcal C_k=\\mathrm{PR}_k\\qquad(k\\in\\omega).","display":true}],"bytes":1326,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-ct]] — 章 17；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-ct]]"}],"outgoing":["e343870c773cb68e","0399f7532457c99d"]}